// with SHA-256. The SHA-256 vectors include every NIST FIPS 180-4 short
// message (up to 512 bytes) and the three longest long messages.
//
// - ECDSA: NIST FIPS 186-4 signature verification test vectors
// - RSA: NIST FIPS 186-4 RSASSA-PKCS1-v15 signature verification test vectors
// - SHA-256: NIST FIPS 180-4 test vectors (short and long messages)
// https://csrc.nist.gov/Projects/Cryptographic-Algorithm-Validation-Program
